      "properties": {
        "text": "HELM LAB (older template). Most people want 'Helm 3 - Make your own axis' instead.\n\nRecords what the model 'thinks' for one prompt, so an axis can be built from two prompts.\n1) Run with the name 'pos' and the prompt that HAS your idea.\n2) Change the name to 'neg' and the prompt to the same text WITHOUT the idea. Run again.\n3) Open helm_vector to combine the two recordings into an axis.\nEverything else in the graph is identical to krea2_helm."
      },
